1
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:15,550
♪I lean and gaze at misty waves afar♪

2
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:18,320
♪Tears fall on the ancient road
'neath the setting sun♪

3
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:21,460
♪One lone shadow on the cold river♪

4
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,910
♪In dreams, I return to the old window♪

5
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:28,670
♪Mountains stretch, the road home fades♪

6
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:32,030
♪A flute cries out, hooves hurry on♪

7
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:34,790
♪My heart adrift beneath a frosted moon♪

8
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:38,220
♪Drinking alone, I mourn our parting♪

9
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:40,050
♪Night turns cold, wind stirs the veil♪

10
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,760
♪Old robes recall forgotten days♪

11
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:43,570
♪Heart sore, a lone goose flies south♪

12
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,230
♪Where shall I send this letter?♪

13
00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:47,760
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

14
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:49,000
♪Love runs deep, dreams linger on♪

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,390
♪Only sorrow remains♪

16
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,340
♪A cup of wine, my shadow makes us two♪

17
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:54,980
♪Drunk and lost through flashing blades♪

18
00:00:54,990 --> 00:00:56,870
♪I curse how swiftly the years pass by♪

19
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,580
♪The wandering road goes on♪

20
00:00:58,590 --> 00:01:01,020
♪Desolate, time frosts my youthful hair♪

21
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:02,340
♪Through the years, love still burns♪

22
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:04,530
♪A thousand tears fall♪

23
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:08,030
♪Worlds apart, tears stain my sleeves♪

24
00:01:08,150 --> 00:01:11,300
♪Old dreams haunt my heart,
tears cloud my eyes♪

25
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:13,340
♪Heartbroken, soul-worn,
pain won't fade♪

26
00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:14,820
♪Moonlight westward, the night drags on♪

27
00:01:14,830 --> 00:01:17,920
♪The years have left their scars♪

28
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:21,280
♪Autumn winds sweep leaves;
shadows pair♪

29
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:24,590
♪The past fades like smoke;
tears fall♪

30
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:26,820
♪My heart lies broken♪

31
00:01:26,830 --> 00:01:30,150
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

32
00:01:30,150 --> 00:01:34,980
[Love Legend]

33
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:38,780
[Episode 20]

34
00:01:48,610 --> 00:01:49,000
Father.

35
00:01:49,770 --> 00:01:52,280
Why did the Noble Consort summon you?

36
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:54,840
It's about Pei Zhao.

37
00:01:55,710 --> 00:01:56,480
He has

38
00:01:56,660 --> 00:01:57,590
been reinstated?

39
00:01:58,120 --> 00:01:59,710
More than that.

40
00:02:00,290 --> 00:02:01,180
From now on,

41
00:02:01,560 --> 00:02:02,920
he'll be Prince Regent,

42
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:04,760
second only to the Emperor.

43
00:02:05,710 --> 00:02:06,580
Prince Regent?

44
00:02:08,590 --> 00:02:09,750
The Noble Consort

45
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:11,030
also wants us

46
00:02:11,250 --> 00:02:12,520
to send a few sensible maids

47
00:02:12,710 --> 00:02:13,640
to serve him.

48
00:02:14,530 --> 00:02:16,560
Why not use her own maids?

49
00:02:17,090 --> 00:02:17,840
These

50
00:02:17,850 --> 00:02:19,870
were carefully chosen in the palace.

51
00:02:20,440 --> 00:02:21,800
They're better

52
00:02:22,030 --> 00:02:23,280
at caring for people than ours.

53
00:02:23,840 --> 00:02:24,630
Stop asking.

54
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:25,630
You're a woman.

55
00:02:26,220 --> 00:02:26,740
Remember,

56
00:02:26,880 --> 00:02:28,360
stay out of court affairs.

57
00:02:30,170 --> 00:02:30,680
Father.

58
00:02:31,690 --> 00:02:32,850
There are matters

59
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:34,540
you can entrust to me.

60
00:02:35,780 --> 00:02:36,600
What do you know?

61
00:02:37,320 --> 00:02:38,710
Better think about

62
00:02:38,910 --> 00:02:40,690
how to keep a man's heart.

63
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:43,200
When it comes to men,

64
00:02:43,630 --> 00:02:45,080
you're nowhere near Yun Shao.

65
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:48,030
As you command.

66
00:02:49,970 --> 00:02:52,150
If only Qi were still here.

67
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:54,870
Darn Pei Zhao.

68
00:02:55,380 --> 00:02:56,680
He killed my son.

69
00:02:57,420 --> 00:02:58,080
I wish I could

70
00:02:58,580 --> 00:02:59,910
tear him limb from limb.

71
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:04,910
Father just said

72
00:03:05,710 --> 00:03:07,030
he'll be Prince Regent.

73
00:03:07,800 --> 00:03:08,470
Then,

74
00:03:08,710 --> 00:03:10,960
the Yun family may have to rely on him.

75
00:03:12,090 --> 00:03:15,800
Should I still marry him?

76
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:17,470
Rely on him?

77
00:03:18,370 --> 00:03:20,100
We can always adopt sons.

78
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:21,470
These next few days,

79
00:03:21,710 --> 00:03:24,280
I'll adopt some capable boys

80
00:03:25,030 --> 00:03:27,430
from the branch families to serve us.

81
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:29,470
You're adopting sons?

82
00:03:31,240 --> 00:03:32,210
You're my eldest daughter.

83
00:03:33,150 --> 00:03:34,680
No matter who you marry,

84
00:03:34,970 --> 00:03:35,560
remember,

85
00:03:36,260 --> 00:03:38,240
the Yun family comes first.

86
00:03:38,950 --> 00:03:39,330
Enough.

87
00:03:40,160 --> 00:03:41,380
I have other matters.

88
00:03:42,630 --> 00:03:44,500
Choose a few capable maids

89
00:03:44,850 --> 00:03:45,910
and take this box of ginseng

90
00:03:46,650 --> 00:03:47,680
to Pei Zhao.

91
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:49,240
You can

92
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:50,370
manage that, right?

93
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:53,360
I'll do it now.

94
00:03:53,890 --> 00:03:54,400
Mm.

95
00:03:56,220 --> 00:03:58,580
[Fengyi Bureau]

96
00:04:00,590 --> 00:04:01,360
Zhao.

97
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:10,150
How did you get hurt so badly?

98
00:04:13,860 --> 00:04:15,080
Thank goodness you're all right.

99
00:04:15,590 --> 00:04:16,650
My lady

100
00:04:16,650 --> 00:04:18,040
worried about you day and night.

101
00:04:18,310 --> 00:04:19,870
Thank goodness you're back safe.

102
00:04:21,770 --> 00:04:22,270
Enough.

103
00:04:27,860 --> 00:04:28,720
Put it down.

104
00:04:28,960 --> 00:04:29,480
Leave.

105
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:30,310
Yes.

106
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:50,840
Zhao.

107
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:52,800
I made this ginseng soup myself.

108
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:53,650
Try some.

109
00:04:56,220 --> 00:04:56,660
No need.

110
00:04:58,710 --> 00:04:59,650
Lady Yun.

111
00:05:00,780 --> 00:05:01,700
Please leave.

112
00:05:10,560 --> 00:05:11,430
Zhao.

113
00:05:12,610 --> 00:05:14,100
My feelings for you are real.

114
00:05:17,060 --> 00:05:17,690
I know

115
00:05:18,220 --> 00:05:19,650
you've misunderstood me.

116
00:05:20,850 --> 00:05:22,440
You think I mistreated Yun Shao.

117
00:05:23,680 --> 00:05:24,750
But I didn't.

118
00:05:26,070 --> 00:05:27,490
In our family,

119
00:05:27,850 --> 00:05:29,780
she lived without a care.

120
00:05:31,190 --> 00:05:32,400
I was the one

121
00:05:33,360 --> 00:05:35,840
who had to master everything.

122
00:05:37,790 --> 00:05:39,530
I had rules for everything.

123
00:05:40,460 --> 00:05:42,340
I had it hardest.

124
00:05:43,990 --> 00:05:46,040
Then trade places with her.

125
00:05:47,440 --> 00:05:48,660
You be the sacrifice.

126
00:05:49,520 --> 00:05:51,540
Let her learn all that.

127
00:05:52,640 --> 00:05:53,800
She was sacrificed

128
00:05:54,430 --> 00:05:57,040
to uphold the family honor

129
00:05:58,270 --> 00:05:59,950
I study day and night

130
00:05:59,950 --> 00:06:01,750
so that one day

131
00:06:01,750 --> 00:06:03,800
I could do the same.

132
00:06:05,430 --> 00:06:08,360
Every Yun is born with that duty.

133
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:10,680
I see nothing wrong with that.

134
00:06:11,830 --> 00:06:13,980
But she's not a Yun.

135
00:06:14,560 --> 00:06:17,270
She lived with us for 18 years.

136
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:20,600
Adopted or not,

137
00:06:21,260 --> 00:06:23,120
she's still a Yun.

138
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:36,080
If it were your daughter,

139
00:06:37,940 --> 00:06:39,480
sent as a sacrifice,

140
00:06:40,880 --> 00:06:42,250
limbs cut off,

141
00:06:43,490 --> 00:06:44,800
eyes gouged out,

142
00:06:45,730 --> 00:06:47,300
blood drained dry,

143
00:06:48,950 --> 00:06:50,240
would you still say

144
00:06:50,780 --> 00:06:53,240
that's her duty?

145
00:07:06,840 --> 00:07:07,510
My lady.

146
00:07:07,720 --> 00:07:08,750
Are we staying here?

147
00:07:10,460 --> 00:07:11,270
He said

148
00:07:11,710 --> 00:07:14,150
only dead women stay in Fengyi Bureau.

149
00:07:17,400 --> 00:07:18,600
Isn't Yun Shao a woman?

150
00:07:20,270 --> 00:07:21,820
I just can't accept it.

151
00:07:23,390 --> 00:07:24,440
In ability,

152
00:07:24,740 --> 00:07:27,310
I'm far better than Yun Qi or Yun Shao.

153
00:07:28,230 --> 00:07:29,470
In beauty and talent,

154
00:07:29,820 --> 00:07:31,310
I'm no less than her.

155
00:07:32,810 --> 00:07:34,120
Princess Consort Pei

156
00:07:35,390 --> 00:07:36,500
will be me.

157
00:07:38,340 --> 00:07:39,310
Yun Shao,

158
00:07:40,450 --> 00:07:42,600
you will never rise above me.

159
00:08:02,930 --> 00:08:04,040
You just saved me.

160
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:05,040
How could I leave you?

161
00:08:05,390 --> 00:08:06,360
At least you have a conscience.

162
00:08:09,830 --> 00:08:10,560
Get up.

163
00:08:13,430 --> 00:08:15,040
Anyone who violates the laws of Yong

164
00:08:15,190 --> 00:08:16,190
may be disciplined with it

165
00:08:16,510 --> 00:08:17,560
without reporting to His Majesty.

166
00:08:18,160 --> 00:08:19,000
These are tonics.

167
00:08:19,040 --> 00:08:20,630
Take them to those young beggars

168
00:08:20,830 --> 00:08:21,800
and the little girl.

169
00:08:22,270 --> 00:08:22,750
Yes.

170
00:08:22,870 --> 00:08:24,360
You really are a kind official.

171
00:08:46,030 --> 00:08:47,240
Mind-Clearing bracelet.

172
00:08:49,750 --> 00:08:50,480
I wonder

173
00:08:50,820 --> 00:08:51,790
if I might be lucky enough

174
00:08:52,350 --> 00:08:53,730
to have one.

175
00:08:57,720 --> 00:08:58,720
You're the Crown Prince.

176
00:09:00,340 --> 00:09:01,270
The bracelet

177
00:09:01,870 --> 00:09:03,550
is too plain for you.

178
00:09:09,790 --> 00:09:11,480
Still upset over Pei Zhao?

179
00:09:15,810 --> 00:09:17,000
If you think about it,

180
00:09:17,450 --> 00:09:18,700
it's not all his fault.

181
00:09:19,310 --> 00:09:19,870
After all,

182
00:09:20,470 --> 00:09:21,480
parents' sins

183
00:09:21,570 --> 00:09:22,290
shouldn't fall on their children.

184
00:09:23,880 --> 00:09:25,630
The blood debt for your mother

185
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:27,240
is for the Noble Consort alone to pay.

186
00:09:27,840 --> 00:09:29,320
If he betrays your devotion,

187
00:09:29,960 --> 00:09:31,120
just take your heart back.

188
00:09:34,920 --> 00:09:35,720
You're right.

189
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:39,910
These Mind-Clearing bracelet

190
00:09:39,910 --> 00:09:41,240
may be too plain for you,

191
00:09:42,900 --> 00:09:44,270
but the black ambergris bracelet

192
00:09:45,370 --> 00:09:46,150
suits you.

193
00:09:52,240 --> 00:09:52,790
Thank you.

194
00:09:53,590 --> 00:09:54,360
I like it very much.

195
00:09:56,500 --> 00:09:57,720
If there's anything you want,

196
00:09:58,030 --> 00:09:58,910
just ask.

197
00:09:59,320 --> 00:10:01,380
I shall place it before you.

198
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:03,360
Then I'll ask

199
00:10:04,320 --> 00:10:05,390
for one thing.

200
00:10:15,020 --> 00:10:15,470
Madam Yun.

201
00:10:15,910 --> 00:10:16,510
Lu.

202
00:10:16,510 --> 00:10:17,150
Yun Shao.

203
00:10:17,390 --> 00:10:18,000
Madam Yun.

204
00:10:18,390 --> 00:10:19,010
Yun Shao.

205
00:10:20,790 --> 00:10:21,380
Are you all right?

206
00:10:22,060 --> 00:10:23,390
Why did you go to the Eastern Palace?

207
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:25,240
There is something I need to know there.

208
00:10:25,670 --> 00:10:27,030
What must you know?

209
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:27,910
If you want to investigate,

210
00:10:27,910 --> 00:10:28,720
I'll go for you.

211
00:10:28,940 --> 00:10:30,440
Gu Qingyan is a dangerous man.

212
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:31,630
Don't let him fool you.

213
00:10:32,120 --> 00:10:32,960
I know what I'm doing.

214
00:10:33,390 --> 00:10:34,360
Yet there are answers

215
00:10:34,800 --> 00:10:35,970
I must find for myself.

216
00:10:36,670 --> 00:10:37,090
Madam Yun.

217
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:39,790
What do you want to know at there?

218
00:10:40,360 --> 00:10:41,040
I want to know

219
00:10:42,120 --> 00:10:43,600
why Pei Zhao betrayed us.

220
00:10:44,720 --> 00:10:45,510
If he won't tell me,

221
00:10:46,150 --> 00:10:47,120
I'll find out myself.

222
00:10:48,830 --> 00:10:49,270
Men's words

223
00:10:49,270 --> 00:10:49,870
are full of lies.

224
00:10:50,120 --> 00:10:51,080
Trust a man?

225
00:10:51,220 --> 00:10:52,480
Trust a rooster to lay eggs first.

226
00:10:53,150 --> 00:10:53,750
Ruoli.

227
00:10:54,920 --> 00:10:55,830
Brother, you're the exception.

228
00:10:55,830 --> 00:10:56,330
Happy?

229
00:10:56,850 --> 00:10:57,550
Ruoming.

230
00:10:57,970 --> 00:10:59,380
[Eastern Palace]
This is an Eastern Palace token.

231
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:00,360
Take it

232
00:11:00,550 --> 00:11:02,030
and get Shandou somewhere safe.

233
00:11:03,030 --> 00:11:04,240
You should keep it.

234
00:11:04,840 --> 00:11:05,670
The Eastern Palace is dangerous.

235
00:11:05,670 --> 00:11:06,510
You can't stay there.

236
00:11:07,150 --> 00:11:08,270
Lord Pei wouldn't allow it either.

237
00:11:09,320 --> 00:11:11,200
He even ignored Chang'an's death.

238
00:11:14,720 --> 00:11:16,200
Does he really care about me?

239
00:11:18,960 --> 00:11:20,030
The Shanhua villagers

240
00:11:20,270 --> 00:11:21,600
are rebel families,

241
00:11:22,150 --> 00:11:24,080
but the war has nothing to do with them.

242
00:11:25,270 --> 00:11:25,880
Ruoming.

243
00:11:25,890 --> 00:11:26,910
Don't waste time.

244
00:11:27,040 --> 00:11:27,720
Take them

245
00:11:27,720 --> 00:11:28,390
and go.

246
00:11:31,270 --> 00:11:31,910
Thank you, Madam Yun.

247
00:11:32,440 --> 00:11:33,150
Be careful.

248
00:11:56,120 --> 00:11:56,600
Your Highness.

249
00:11:57,150 --> 00:11:58,650
Lady Yun came to meet the rebels.

250
00:11:59,670 --> 00:12:01,440
If they learn who she really is,

251
00:12:01,440 --> 00:12:02,120
wouldn't that...

252
00:12:02,270 --> 00:12:03,360
So what if they know?

253
00:12:03,670 --> 00:12:04,630
She's in the Eastern Palace.

254
00:12:04,630 --> 00:12:05,510
She can't escape.

255
00:12:05,670 --> 00:12:07,440
Even if she learns the truth,

256
00:12:07,600 --> 00:12:09,510
I can keep her by my side.

257
00:12:10,030 --> 00:12:10,460
Hyah.

258
00:12:14,830 --> 00:12:15,520
Who's this?

259
00:12:18,120 --> 00:12:20,200
Pei Zhao ignores me now?

260
00:12:20,930 --> 00:12:21,430
Your Highness.

261
00:12:21,530 --> 00:12:22,120
It's Pei Zhao.

262
00:12:22,870 --> 00:12:23,810
His back's healed?

263
00:12:24,480 --> 00:12:25,480
Impossible.

264
00:12:27,840 --> 00:12:29,440
You beat him badly that day.

265
00:12:29,440 --> 00:12:30,550
His whole back was torn open.

266
00:12:31,150 --> 00:12:32,250
It's not humanly possible

267
00:12:34,410 --> 00:12:35,990
to get back on his feet

268
00:12:36,450 --> 00:12:37,220
and ride a horse.

269
00:12:38,150 --> 00:12:38,960
Follow him.

270
00:12:39,240 --> 00:12:40,200
See what he's up to.

271
00:12:40,630 --> 00:12:41,330
Yes, Your Highness.

272
00:12:51,980 --> 00:12:52,370
Sir.

273
00:12:53,360 --> 00:12:54,290
Lord Pei.

274
00:12:54,590 --> 00:12:55,240
We're safe.

275
00:12:57,160 --> 00:12:57,760
Arrest them.

276
00:13:07,380 --> 00:13:07,770
Sir.

277
00:13:08,120 --> 00:13:08,620
What are you doing?

278
00:13:09,920 --> 00:13:11,220
Lu Li colluded with rebels.

279
00:13:11,510 --> 00:13:12,360
If he dares resist,

280
00:13:12,560 --> 00:13:13,340
kill him on the spot.

281
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:19,630
I'll kill you, you heartless beast.

282
00:13:22,800 --> 00:13:23,210
Ruoli.

283
00:13:23,400 --> 00:13:23,860
Are you all right?

284
00:13:25,750 --> 00:13:26,940
This is your good official?

285
00:13:27,220 --> 00:13:27,610
Let go.

286
00:13:32,870 --> 00:13:33,670
Pei Zhao.

287
00:13:35,230 --> 00:13:36,100
Pei Zhao, let them go.

288
00:13:37,890 --> 00:13:38,480
Pei Zhao.

289
00:13:39,270 --> 00:13:40,200
What are you doing?

290
00:13:40,670 --> 00:13:41,960
Fengyi Bureau is on official business.

291
00:13:41,960 --> 00:13:42,910
Anyone who interferes

292
00:13:42,910 --> 00:13:43,390
dies.

293
00:13:46,840 --> 00:13:47,320
Fine.

294
00:13:48,600 --> 00:13:49,960
You're forcing us into a corner.

295
00:13:50,910 --> 00:13:52,370
Don't blame me for being ruthless.

296
00:13:59,200 --> 00:13:59,830
Where's Yun Shao?

297
00:14:00,570 --> 00:14:01,220
Pei Zhao.

298
00:14:05,160 --> 00:14:05,570
We're safe now.

299
00:14:10,230 --> 00:14:10,930
If I'd known this would happen,

300
00:14:11,470 --> 00:14:12,920
I never would've saved Pei Zhao.

301
00:14:13,700 --> 00:14:15,040
He's the one

302
00:14:15,240 --> 00:14:15,900
who sold out Shanhua Valley.

303
00:14:16,440 --> 00:14:17,240
He could not have done it.

304
00:14:17,600 --> 00:14:18,470
What happened at Shanhua Valley

305
00:14:18,790 --> 00:14:19,690
was Prince of Xin'an's doing.

306
00:14:19,910 --> 00:14:21,210
Prince of Xin'an is his father.

307
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:22,570
They're family.

308
00:14:23,650 --> 00:14:24,780
My lord may be innocent.

309
00:14:24,950 --> 00:14:25,310
You...

310
00:14:26,790 --> 00:14:28,210
Have you lost your minds?

311
00:14:28,690 --> 00:14:30,370
His blade is at our throats,

312
00:14:30,370 --> 00:14:31,580
and you still trust him?

313
00:14:32,840 --> 00:14:33,230
Yun Shao.

314
00:14:33,560 --> 00:14:34,090
What do you think?

315
00:14:35,320 --> 00:14:35,890
Forget him.

316
00:14:37,230 --> 00:14:37,840
Right now,

317
00:14:38,150 --> 00:14:39,630
we need somewhere safe

318
00:14:39,630 --> 00:14:40,630
to settle everyone.

319
00:14:42,370 --> 00:14:43,010
Only if you're safe

320
00:14:43,360 --> 00:14:45,210
can the rebels face the court's troops.

321
00:14:45,700 --> 00:14:46,390
But now,

322
00:14:47,030 --> 00:14:47,910
where is safe?

323
00:14:49,510 --> 00:14:50,390
The people left

324
00:14:50,800 --> 00:14:52,030
are old, weak, sick, or injured.

325
00:14:52,590 --> 00:14:53,310
They can't fight

326
00:14:53,900 --> 00:14:54,740
or run.

327
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:57,050
There is one place

328
00:14:58,080 --> 00:14:59,300
we can hide them.

329
00:15:12,200 --> 00:15:12,940
Where were you?

330
00:15:17,230 --> 00:15:18,410
I said goodbye to Ruoli and the others.

331
00:15:19,720 --> 00:15:20,440
Right now,

332
00:15:20,840 --> 00:15:22,320
it's dangerous everywhere.

333
00:15:22,840 --> 00:15:24,120
We need a foolproof plan

334
00:15:24,120 --> 00:15:25,030
to hide them.

335
00:15:26,080 --> 00:15:27,630
I've done all I can.

336
00:15:28,270 --> 00:15:29,000
The rest

337
00:15:30,200 --> 00:15:31,320
is up to fate.

338
00:15:31,790 --> 00:15:33,000
With me here,

339
00:15:33,000 --> 00:15:33,910
I'll help you handle it.

340
00:15:38,200 --> 00:15:38,790
Your Highness.

341
00:15:39,270 --> 00:15:39,770
It is late.

342
00:15:40,970 --> 00:15:41,870
Please get some rest.

343
00:15:43,390 --> 00:15:43,900
All right.

344
00:16:17,990 --> 00:16:18,430
Your Highness.

345
00:16:20,060 --> 00:16:20,500
Your Highness.

346
00:16:21,310 --> 00:16:22,690
The Noble Consort summons you.

347
00:16:23,310 --> 00:16:24,040
Again?

348
00:16:25,070 --> 00:16:26,350
What does she want now?

349
00:16:27,080 --> 00:16:27,500
I'm not going.

350
00:16:28,240 --> 00:16:29,480
You should go.

351
00:16:29,480 --> 00:16:30,200
Right now,

352
00:16:30,200 --> 00:16:32,240
you really shouldn't

353
00:16:32,240 --> 00:16:33,390
fall out with her.

354
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:40,960
Yun Shao's skilled
with sedative incense.

355
00:16:42,150 --> 00:16:43,240
Stay sharp.

356
00:16:43,240 --> 00:16:43,720
Yes.

357
00:16:51,410 --> 00:16:52,080
Your Highness.

358
00:16:52,080 --> 00:16:53,020
The Crown Prince has arrived.

359
00:17:00,670 --> 00:17:02,630
Greetings, Mother Consort.

360
00:17:03,880 --> 00:17:04,780
Qingyan, you're here.

361
00:17:05,440 --> 00:17:06,510
Let's wait for Pei Zhao.

362
00:17:06,680 --> 00:17:07,480
Once he arrives,

363
00:17:07,600 --> 00:17:08,510
we'll begin the banquet.

364
00:17:09,010 --> 00:17:10,720
Your Highness.

365
00:17:13,870 --> 00:17:14,590
Your Highness.

366
00:17:14,590 --> 00:17:16,240
Lord Pei went after the rebels.

367
00:17:16,240 --> 00:17:17,680
His wounds got worse.

368
00:17:17,680 --> 00:17:18,630
He can't attend.

369
00:17:20,270 --> 00:17:21,750
How could you let this happen?

370
00:17:21,750 --> 00:17:23,070
He's covered in wounds.

371
00:17:23,210 --> 00:17:24,640
How could you let him travel like that?

372
00:17:25,030 --> 00:17:25,790
Go.

373
00:17:25,790 --> 00:17:26,640
Send an imperial physician.

374
00:17:26,640 --> 00:17:27,240
Now.

375
00:17:27,830 --> 00:17:28,350
Your Highness...

376
00:17:28,350 --> 00:17:29,110
Go.

377
00:17:29,220 --> 00:17:29,750
Yes.

378
00:17:32,960 --> 00:17:33,890
It seems Mother Consort

379
00:17:34,270 --> 00:17:35,250
is in no mood to dine.

380
00:17:36,200 --> 00:17:37,500
I shall take my leave.

381
00:17:38,170 --> 00:17:38,750
Stop right there.

382
00:17:41,880 --> 00:17:43,000
Everyone,

383
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:43,750
leave us.

384
00:17:54,880 --> 00:17:56,200
Mother Consort, you'd best hurry

385
00:17:56,200 --> 00:17:57,530
to see your precious Zhao.

386
00:17:57,620 --> 00:17:59,510
Don't waste time on me.

387
00:18:00,350 --> 00:18:01,510
Don't be childish.

388
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:03,570
I have something important to tell you.

389
00:18:04,750 --> 00:18:05,970
In your heart,

390
00:18:06,530 --> 00:18:07,760
besides Pei Zhao,

391
00:18:08,200 --> 00:18:10,030
what else is important?

392
00:18:12,720 --> 00:18:14,400
To make him Crown Prince instead?

393
00:18:14,410 --> 00:18:15,620
Is that important?

394
00:18:15,770 --> 00:18:16,960
What nonsense is that?

395
00:18:17,710 --> 00:18:18,830
The one after your position

396
00:18:19,240 --> 00:18:20,410
was never Pei Zhao.

397
00:18:33,560 --> 00:18:36,370
♪A cold blade gleams by the window♪

398
00:18:37,990 --> 00:18:41,180
♪Candle tears harden into frost♪

399
00:18:42,500 --> 00:18:44,240
♪Moon shadows flicker and sway♪

400
00:18:44,740 --> 00:18:49,180
♪A wisp of longing haunts the air♪

401
00:18:51,340 --> 00:18:54,010
♪A lone boat rests on the misty river♪

402
00:18:55,230 --> 00:19:00,240
♪That promise lies sealed with my sword♪

403
00:19:00,560 --> 00:19:08,590
♪I turn to find the world in snow♪

404
00:19:08,860 --> 00:19:17,480
♪Fated destiny ties from bygone life♪

405
00:19:17,480 --> 00:19:26,150
♪Longing for one beloved flows on♪

406
00:19:26,530 --> 00:19:35,400
♪I can't let go of the verses lost
across this vast land♪

407
00:19:35,830 --> 00:19:44,320
♪Yet I let go of that fleeting light
within your eyes♪
